{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8cfd6006945d280a6d6","chatId":"5cfdda43e91247e1b12cd02f8711b7dd","sessionId":null,"userId":68894,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":847,"promptTokens":1470,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:23"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00590839775353016,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8cfd6006945d280a6d5","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369743110,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:23","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8cfd6006945d280a6d5","chatId":"5cfdda43e91247e1b12cd02f8711b7dd","sessionId":null,"userId":68894,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n西蒙是一个业余画家，他花了一个多星期画他的已故宠物的肖像。在他完成后，他退后一步，立刻发现他把他的宠物的毛发颜色画错了。就在这时，他的妻子看到了这幅画，惊呼：“这正是我记得的样子！”\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，西蒙最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 惊喜\nB) 生气\nC) 尴尬\nD) 绝望\nE) 自豪\nF) 失望\n\n## 问题 2\n西蒙为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他认为他花了一副完美的画\nB) 他的妻子欣赏他的努力，喜欢他的画\nC) 他在画画时犯了错并且很在意\nD) 他的妻子欣赏他的努力，即使发现了他的错误","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.00590839775353016,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8cfd6006945d280a6d6","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369743108,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:23","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"efbf3689a50246bd98904c9274dfee73"}